<h2
  style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #1F2937; margin-bottom: 20px;"
>Verify your email</h2>

<p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4B5563;">Hi {{name}},</p>

<p style="font-size: 16px; color: #4B5563;">
  Thanks for joining
  <strong>FoodMatrix</strong>! We're thrilled to have you. Please verify your
  email address to unlock all features and start planning your perfect meals.
</p>

<div style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" class="button">Verify Email Address</a>
</div>

<div
  style="background-color: #F8F7FF; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 30px;"
>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6B7280; line-height: 1.5;">
    If the button above doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your
    browser:<br />
    <a
      href="{{verifyUrl}}"
      style="color: #7661d3; word-break: break-all;"
    >{{verifyUrl}}</a>
  </p>
</div>

<p
  style="font-size: 15px; color: #4B5563; border-top: 1px solid #F3F4F6; padding-top: 30px; margin-top: 30px;"
>
  Happy cooking,<br />
  <span class="highlight">The FoodMatrix Onboarding Team</span>
</p>